 inviting floorplan. A sunlit front den leads to the dining area & beautifully appointed kitchen, where custom cabinetry, S/S appliances & large island take center stage. A sunken rear living room opens onto an expansive patio & private yard wrapped in mature trees & perennial gardens. Three main-floor bedrooms include a spacious primary w/ spa-inspired 4 pc ensuite that incl. double sinks, and a walk-in shower. FULLY FINISHED BASEMENT introduces an airy great room, intimate TV lounge & 4th bedroom. Don't miss the double garage, oversized driveway, HWT (2023) & mostly updated windows (2017). Exceptional setting, moments from schools, trails, parkland & the Sturgeon River. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$639,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,571 sq ft"],["Year built","1974"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Braeside"],["Town","St. Albert"],["Postal code","T8N2K5"],["MLS® number","E4514884"],["Listed","October 30, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Gas stove(s), Dishwasher, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Storage Shed, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.96 m × 5.24 m (13'0\" × 17'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.96 m × 2.98 m (13'0\" × 9'9\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.93 m × 5.15 m (12'11\" × 16'11\")"],["Den","Main level","3.98 m × 3.94 m (13'1\" × 12'11\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","4.09 m × 4.36 m (13'5\" × 14'4\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.91 m × 2.77 m (9'7\" × 9'1\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","2.81 m × 3.84 m (9'3\" × 12'7\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement",""],["Great room","Basement",""],["Media","Basement",""]],"courtesy":"Matthew Labas, RE/MAX Professionals and Keir McIntyre, RE/MAX Professionals","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"st-albert","hood_slug":"braeside","area":""}